      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.3.0</h3>
<p>The session list now looks like it belongs on a Mac.</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>Rounded, inset selection</b> instead of a full-width slab of colour.</li>
  <li><b>A translucent sidebar</b>, the way Finder and Mail draw theirs.</li>
  <li><b>Taller rows</b> — a name and an address on two lines had almost no
      space around them.</li>
</ul>
<p>Connecting, transferring and logging are unchanged.</p>]]></description>
